  "aiContextParagraph": "The dispute centers on the performance of the Karthigai Deepam ritual on the hill at Tirupparankundram, a significant cultural and religious event in Madurai, Tamil Nadu. Recent legal activity has seen the Supreme Court of India step in to address petitions alleging non-compliance with court orders concerning the lighting of the flame. The situation involves conflicting accounts from Sthanika Bhattars regarding the ceremony's conduct, alongside broader political tensions involving regional parties such as the Bharatiya Janata Party. The court's intervention highlights ongoing concerns over administrative failures and the adherence to religious protocols at the site, with the judiciary now focusing on enforcing compliance through potential contempt proceedings. This development remains a focal point of legal and public discussion in the region as stakeholders await the implementation of the court's latest directives for the temple authorities.",
